    <string name="dialogNote_msg_adhan_alarm_mode">"Due to a newly added feature on the latest versions of Android, Athan notification may not fire on time when the phone is on sleep mode (screen off). We have added a new feature called 'Athan Alarm Mode' that will make sure to fire the Athan with no delay. However, using this mode necessitates showing an alarm icon (⏰) on your notification bar. If this icon bothers you, you can switch to the standard mode anytime following: &lt;b>Preferences > Athan and Reminders > Athan Alarm Mode&lt;b/>"</string>
    <string name="dialogNote_msg_paris">We are pleased to inform you that, in addition to the method of the Union of Islamic Organizations, we have added the ability to calculate prayer times based on the method of the Great Mosque of Paris. Thank you to specify the proper method for you in the prayer times settings.</string>
    <string name="dialogNote_msg_ramadan">"Salatuk team wishes you Ramadan Mubarak Kareem.
We are pleased to inform you that we make many efforts to ensure that the prayer times are accurate. However, in some countries those times may be not exact. In this case, please refer to the official Islamic institutions or mosques in your country and send us the correct times to take them in consideration."</string>
    <string name="dialogNote_msg_times">We are pleased to inform you that we make many efforts to ensure that the prayer times are accurate. However, in some countries those times may be not exact. In this case, please refer to the official Islamic institutions or mosques in your country and send us the correct times to take them in consideration.</string>
